    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d125-a1">

                <pb facs="0211" n="129" sameAs="frus:frus1865p3/pg129"/>

                <head ana="#head_untitled-missing-head-in-printed-volume">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State for Foreign
                                Affairs,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-05-16"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >May</hi> 16, 1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>I have the honor of handing yon for your information the enclosed copy of a
                    despatch which the secretary of the chamber of deputies, now dissolved,
                    addressed to me under date of 13th instant, and likewise of the motion which
                    accompanied the same, made by one of its members, and unanimously voted, on the
                    occasion of communicating to the said chamber the note which you addressed to
                    the house on the 10th instant.</p>
                <p>I avail of this opportunity to renew the assurances of my most distinguished
                    consideration.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>COUNT D’AVILA.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">James E. Harvey,</hi> Esq., <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
